eo></div><br>Think you can drive it better? Jump behind the wheel and drive (or fly) these classic machines of war yourself.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Miniaturized Mayhem</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446160/extras/de270c28c56c19b31e82f9f37e446d9d.poster.avif?t=1666185853\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446160/extras/de270c28c56c19b31e82f9f37e446d9d.webm?t=1666185853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446160/extras/de270c28c56c19b31e82f9f37e446d9d.mp4?t=1666185853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Intense battlefield action as these miniature models unleash mayhem on each other!",
